{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NARRENSCHIFF\u201d (The Ship of Fools) is a horror puzzle-adventure game set in the 1980s,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > featuring a blend of retro pixel art and hand-drawn pencil style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a fictional Eastern European country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Wayde Othman, a data entry clerk from the Bureau of Environment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >venturing into an almost deserted psychiatric hospital,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >searching for your lost memories and uncovering the vast conspiracy brewing within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+++</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by science fiction novels such as Solaris and Annihilation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience mysterious phenomena beyond scientific explanation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where memories and reality intertwine,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing you a truly unique adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2521400?t=1770234425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521400/7159bcf3abcf2c94d945d8d277733b516efc218e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770234425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521400/7eec28c94d470fbd1244f016f60d62adf7ebc238/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770234425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521400/7eec28c94d470fbd1244f016f60d62adf7ebc238/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770234425","categories":[{"description":"Single-pla